; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 16. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'na49_neil'
na49_neil.dialogstring_05D984! `[PAU:1E][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: It's open, come in.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Neil. It's Will,[N]from South Cape.[END]`
na49_neil.dialogstring_05D9C1! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Will! Wow![WAI][N]You've really grown since[N]I last saw you.[WAI][N]That longer hair really[N]suits you, too.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_lily'
na49_lily.dialogstring_05DDC0! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Hello. We're Will's[N]friends. My name[AD][WAI][N]What's that horrible smell?[END]`
na49_lily.dialogstring_05DDDF! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Kara! You can't[N]just say that![WAI][N]Try something nicer,[N]like...[WAI][N]"The room has a very[N]powerful smell."[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_neil'
na49_neil.dialogstring_05DA04! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: That's hardly[N]better! You two are[N]brutally honest.[WAI][N]When I'm absorbed in an[N]invention, I stop noticing[N]little things like clothes[N]and bathing.[WAI][N]Still, I didn't think I[N]smelled that bad.[WAI][N]These socks haven't even[N]been on for a full month![END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_lance'
na49_lance.dialogstring_05E1EE! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: I've only had[N]mine on for three weeks.[N]Guess I lose![WAI][N]Of course... I did forget[N]a lot during that time.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_kara'
na49_kara.dialogstring_05E086! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Anything I said[N]about enjoying your musk[N]was just sun poisoning[N]and heat stroke![END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_neil'
na49_neil.dialogstring_05DAC7! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Alright, enough[N]about socks. Welcome. Make[N]yourselves at home.[WAI][N]I have leftovers that are[N]only a few days old...[WAI][N]I [SFX:A]think.[END]`
na49_neil.dialogstring_05DB1C! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: It's been about two[N]years, hasn't it?[WAI][N]I've built all sorts of[N]things since then.[WAI][N]There are four inventions[N]in this room I'm rather[N]proud of.[WAI][N]Go ahead and look around.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_erik'
na49_erik.dialogstring_05E2CE! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I bet Seth would've[N]loved seeing all these[N]inventions[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_tank'
na49_tank.dialogstring_05E327! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: That's an oxygen[N]tank. It stores air.[WAI][N]Wear it and you can[N]breathe underwater.[WAI][N]Right now it only holds[N]about a minute's worth.[WAI][N]If I find a way to[N]compress the air, it could[N]last much longer.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_wings'
na49_wings.dialogstring_05E419! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Those are aeroplane[N]wings.[WAI][N]They're part of a[N]machine made to fulfill[N]humanity's dream of[N]flying like birds.[WAI][N]The rest of the body is[N]much larger, and it needs[N]a long runway to take off.[WAI][N]That's why I keep it out[N]in the desert.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_telescope'
na49_telescope.dialogstring_05E4F9! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: That's the[N]telescope.[WAI][N]With it, you can see the[N]stars as if you could hold[N]them in your hand.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_camera'
na49_camera.dialogstring_05E55C! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: That's a camera.[WAI][N]It fixes an image of the[N]world onto photographic[N]paper.[WAI][N]The trouble is that an[N]exposure takes nearly 30[N]minutes.[WAI][N]Landscapes don't mind, but[N]people have to sit still[N]without blinking.[WAI][N]Their eyes often come[N]out bright red like a[N]rabbit's.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_neil'
na49_neil.dialogstring_05DD04! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Will, where are you[N]going?[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]You took the trouble of[N]coming here, so relax a[N]while longer before you[N]go.[END]`
na49_neil.dialogstring_05DB9C! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: You're a long way[N]from South Cape. What[N]brings you out here?[FIN][CLD][DEF]Will tells Neil about his[N]father's voice, the ruins,[N]and the scattered Mystic[N]Statues.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Hm. Now that's[N]interesting. I've studied[N]ancient ruins a little[N]myself.[FIN]These ruins belong to[N]different peoples and[N]different ages.[FIN]Yet their legends keep[N]circling the same stars.[FIN]There's a theory that if[N]you draw lines between[N]the ruins on a map, they[N]form Cygnus, the swan.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_kara'
na49_kara.dialogstring_05E0C1! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Cygnus?![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Exactly. And the[N]Tower of Babel, where[N]Will's father vanished,[WAI][N]lies almost perfectly in[N]the center of that giant[N]swan.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_lily'
na49_lily.dialogstring_05DE46! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Well, now that you[N]mention it, there's been a[N]new red star underneath[N]Cygnus as of late…[FIN][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Exactly…! You know a[N]lot, don't you?[FIN]Between the new star[N]appearing in Cygnus and[N]Will's talk of ruins,[FIN]these various elements are[N]tied together too neatly[N]for it to happen[N]organically…[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]I don't know if it's[N]coincidence or conspiracy,[N]but the fact is that[N]something is going to[N]happen.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]However, the circumstances[N]are good.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]The desert of the Nazca[N]lines is at most a day's[N]walk to the east from[N]here.[FIN][::]Will you check it out?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No[PAL:4]`
na49_lily.dialogstring_05DF9F! `[CLR]Neil: Hey, don't say that.[N]You know, to tell you the[N]truth, I want to go[N]myself.[FIN][JMP:&dialogstring_05DE46+M]`
na49_lily.dialogstring_05DFC3! `[CLR]Neil: Alright…! I guess[N]it's settled then.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_lance'
na49_lance.dialogstring_05E227! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: We're going too…![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Will won't be tha only one[N]who can have fun memories.[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2]The party headed to the[N]Nazca desert…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'na49_lily'
na49_lily.dialogstring_05DFDC! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: He's Will's cousin,[N]so I'll be polite[AD][WAI][N]But are inventors always[N]like this?[END]`
